&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6443&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on operator role. You will update risk registers yourself, run functional risk lead check-ins, and produce board materials. No direct reports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6603&quot;&gt;Alpaca has the ERM framework, taxonomy, and scoring model. As ERM Program Manager, you will own execution: intake from functional risk leads, risk register hygiene, residual scoring with risk owners, and board-ready reporting on schedule. You report to the &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;CISO&lt;/span&gt; / ERM Lead and work closely with the ERM Working Group, functional risk leads, and local entity leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
