&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with an identity provider and SSO, including SAML and OIDC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience enforcing phishing-resistant MFA, such as FIDO2 or hardware security keys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with an endpoint detection and response platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting or automation experience (Python, Bash, or PowerShell)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with zero-trust network access or device-posture controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of email authentication (SPF, DKIM, DMARC) and phishing response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with IT teams and translating security requirements into operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience investigating identity, endpoint, or email security alerts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to participate in an on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
