&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alpaca is already the infrastructure layer that hundreds of partners build on for execution. Nobody else is both the execution layer and the data layer - and that makes us the natural one-stop shop for brokerage plus market data. We&#39;re hiring a Lead Product Manager to own that second half: define and grow Alpaca&#39;s market data business as a standalone, revenue-generating product line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Lead Product Manager, Market Data to define and own Alpaca&#39;s market data strategy - both as a capability that powers our platform and as a standalone, revenue-generating product line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is equal parts strategy and delivery. You&#39;ll decide what data we source, how we package and price it, what we build versus buy - and then ship the APIs, feeds, and tooling that partners and internal teams depend on every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You&#39;ll Walk Into&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won&#39;t be starting from zero - you&#39;ll be owning live problems:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple new exchange onboardings in flight, each with its own licensing, entitlement, and redistribution constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pricing and packaging model that needs rethinking as we expand across asset classes and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners asking for data we don&#39;t serve yet - consolidated feeds, historical datasets, derived analytics - you&#39;ll be building those requests against cost and commercial upside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal teams (trading, algo routing, compliance, clearing) consuming market data with no product owner ensuring coverage keeps pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Things You Get To Do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate or inform negotiations on exchange licensing, redistribution rights, and entitlements as Alpaca onboards new exchanges and asset classes - you&#39;ll talk to vendors and global venues directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess build-vs-buy for data infrastructure: where do we source from third parties, where do we invest in proprietary collection and normalization, and where do we create derived or value-added data products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the commercial model: define pricing and packaging (real-time vs. delayed, depth-of-book tiers, historical datasets, derived analytics) and work with sales to grow market data revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the competitive position: understand how dedicated market data providers price and differentiate, and identify where Alpaca&#39;s bundled brokerage-plus-data model creates a defensible edge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the developer experience for market data APIs (REST, WebSocket/SSE, historical endpoints) - coverage, latency, reliability, and documentation that developers actually want to read.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead partner discovery: understand what data capabilities are table-stakes vs. differentiating for neobrokers, RIAs, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, and turn that into prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
