&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As a Project Manager, you will be expected to leverage deep cross-functional expertise to coordinate with enterprise customers globally, guiding integrations from conception to launch by aligning technical teams, managing timelines, mitigating risks, and ensuring all deliverables meet strategic objectives in the following ways:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
