&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cloud security logging (AWS/GCP/Azure) and SaaS security telemetry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Kubernetes-hosted security tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a managed SOC or MSSP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security certifications (GCIA, GCIH, GCED, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
