&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting or Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of progressive accounting experience, preferably within financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of accounting principles and financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail with a high degree of accuracy and organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, evolving environment while working independently in a remote setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to changing business needs and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills with a team-first mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership, initiative, and a willingness to take on new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;preferred):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPA designation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working for a broker-dealer, clearing firm, or other regulated financial services organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Netsuite&lt;/li&gt;
