&lt;li&gt;API-first or broker-as-a-service / correspondent platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US and Canada dual-entity operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep CDS / CDSX or Canadian market-infrastructure experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Registered-account or Canadian tax-ops stand-up (TFSA, RRSP, RESP, tax lots, withholding, reporting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native ops workflow: recurring use of tools like Cursor, Claude, ChatGPT, or custom agents for SOP drafting, exception synthesis, and prototyping&lt;/li&gt;
