&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3433&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot incidents and reported bugs to maintain system integrity and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
