&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3523&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in on-call rotations and assist with timely engineering projects and production issues during Japan business hours.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
